  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 165, Number 21 (Monday, February 4, 2019)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"http://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. SCALISE:\nH.R. 949.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nThe First Amendment guarantees both free speech and the\nfree exercise of religion.The Free Speech Fairness Act\nrestores these fundamental liberties to churches and\nnonprofits.\n[Page H1350]\n</pre>",
